{"id":5557,"date":"2026-01-21T10:30:00","date_gmt":"2026-01-21T09:30:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=5557"},"modified":"2025-12-23T14:17:53","modified_gmt":"2025-12-23T13:17:53","slug":"8-ideas-for-your-own-website-in-2026","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/8-ideas-for-your-own-website-in-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"8 Ideas for Your Own Website in 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So you want to start a website? That&#8217;s great news! There&#8217;s always room for a new, creative voice on the internet. But what should you start with? In this article, we share 8 ideas for your own website, each with a lot of potential. Once you&#8217;ve chosen an idea, it&#8217;s important to put your own spin on it to stand out, because that&#8217;s how you become unique.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ready for the first idea?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1: Blog<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The first idea for creating your own website is to\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426727629713-How-to-start-a-blog\">start a blog<\/a>\u00a0. What could be more fun than writing about topics you find interesting?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Then you might be wondering:&nbsp;<em>isn&#8217;t a blog a bit old-fashioned?&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No. Absolutely not. As long as people use the internet to search for information, a blog isn&#8217;t outdated. Your blog posts can appear in search results, helping people find your website.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether it&#8217;s about pets or financial tips\u2026 the topics people are searching for are topics you can be found for. And that creates opportunities!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Over time, as you generate significant traffic to your website, you can even link your blog to various revenue models. Think of selling courses, placing affiliate links, or promoting specific products.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"681\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/glenn-carstens-peters-npxXWgQ33ZQ-unsplash-1-1024x681.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4385\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.503692101141195;width:531px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/glenn-carstens-peters-npxXWgQ33ZQ-unsplash-1-1024x681.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/glenn-carstens-peters-npxXWgQ33ZQ-unsplash-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/glenn-carstens-peters-npxXWgQ33ZQ-unsplash-1-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/glenn-carstens-peters-npxXWgQ33ZQ-unsplash-1-1536x1022.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/glenn-carstens-peters-npxXWgQ33ZQ-unsplash-1-2048x1363.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2: Webshop<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/sections\/29387580921617-Online-store-in-3-steps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">starting an online store<\/a>\u00a0, you can sell products you&#8217;re passionate about.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>\u201cBut what on earth can I sell?<\/em>&nbsp;\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Consider the following questions:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Which products do you like to use?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What gets you excited?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>And which products are difficult to obtain?\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Perhaps these are products that you can sell with your webshop.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3: Portfolio website<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A portfolio website allows you to showcase your work to the world. This makes a portfolio website a powerful tool for acquiring new clients. Such a website offers opportunities, particularly for:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Photographers<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Video makers<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Graphic Designers<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Artists<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Singers \/ Bands<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A portfolio website allows you to showcase your creative work, giving people a good idea of \u200b\u200bwhat you could do for them.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4: Freelance&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This idea is very similar to a portfolio website. The main difference between these two websites is that the portfolio website focuses more on showcasing creative work, while the freelance website focuses more on promoting freelance work.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you want to start your own business as a freelancer, it&#8217;s important to have a website where potential clients can see what you can do for them. A freelance website offers many opportunities, for example:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Lawyers<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Copywriters<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Marketers<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Translators<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Social Media Managers<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/jazmin-quaynor-18mUXUS8ksI-unsplash-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"schedule ads\" class=\"wp-image-3457\" style=\"width:597px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/jazmin-quaynor-18mUXUS8ksI-unsplash-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/jazmin-quaynor-18mUXUS8ksI-unsplash-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5: Affiliate<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This website features affiliate links, allowing you to generate income by recommending products.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">An affiliate link is a link that tells the seller which affiliate placed an order. This affiliate then receives a commission. This is a significant source of income, especially for bloggers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The reason that online stores like Amazon.com became the go-to place for online shopping was partly due to the launch of Amazon Affiliates. This gave websites around the world the opportunity to direct their web traffic to Amazon in exchange for a commission after the sale.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By writing reviews or blog posts you can drive traffic to your affiliate website, where you can then place affiliate links.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6: Quiz Site&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In recent years, search volume for online quizzes, questions, and online games has increased rapidly. Demand has been particularly high since the coronavirus pandemic, as many of these games were organized at home.\u00a0<br>You too can capitalize on this trend by creating a website where people can find these games. A great opportunity is to sell paid versions in addition to offering free games. This way, you can also monetize your website. An example of this is\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/quizbrothers.nl\/\">Quiz Brothers<\/a>\u00a0.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>7: Coaching<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These days, the barrier to becoming a coach is lower than ever. This makes it easier to help people in a field you find interesting.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Ask yourself the following:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>What am I good at?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What am I better at than most people?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What would I like to help people with?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>What have I studied in?<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Creating a coaching website allows potential clients to see your expertise. If you also use this coaching website to blog, you can attract potential clients more quickly. Competition is high, but launching a blog can help you attract more traffic. <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/image-4.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1973\" style=\"width:576px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/image-4.png 720w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/image-4-300x225.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>8: Education Website<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The final website idea we&#8217;d like to share is an educational website. If you&#8217;re adept in a particular field, you can package and sell your knowledge on your educational website. You can sell various courses on this website, or create a portal where you publish monthly content.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This educational website allows people to acquire your knowledge for a fee. However, it&#8217;s important to specialize in one area of \u200b\u200bexpertise with this website so you can build authority more quickly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this article, we&#8217;ve shared 8 ideas for creating your own website. It&#8217;s important to give these ideas a personal touch so your new website stands out more quickly. There&#8217;s always room on the internet for a new creative voice.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-